{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52838","headline":"同前赋附归云之曲 · 乔潭","name":"同前赋附归云之曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归云之状兮不一，归云之趣兮难俦。\n云不以朝脯而异赏，士不以前後而异求。\n诚在位之如是，知夫鸿渐之高秋。\n（均见《文苑英华》卷十一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔潭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}